  "title": "Implement Idempotency Keys for Operations",
  "description": "Implement idempotency keys for claim and advance operations to prevent duplicate processing from retries. Clients include an idempotency key header or parameter. The server stores the key and its result; replayed requests return the cached result without re-executing. Keys expire after a configurable TTL.",
